(7705114, 1265151, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!  Sometimes something can be so beautiful it''s almost painful.  This is one of those.  Reminiscent of East Asian pen, and brush too, I guess, and ink drawings, fine, tender and evocative.  The bubbles ornament both tree and water.  And if the water is seen as sky, the bubbles are celestial showers.  Gray and black were never so exciting.

<br/>Personal co-favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful!  Sometimes something can be so beautiful it''s almost painful.  This is one of those.  Reminiscent of East Asian pen, and brush too, I guess, and ink drawings, fine, tender and evocative.  The bubbles ornament both tree and water.  And if the water is seen as sky, the bubbles are celestial showers.  Gray and black were never so exciting.

Personal co-favorite of the challenge.', '2021-10-30 15:59:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(7705115, 1265136, 173844, '<td valign="top">Black is as much a character in this image as the mysterious man at its top.  Very powerful and cinematic, noir.  The reflections of merely the orange lanterns and the entering light substantiate the whole, which whole is substantiated many times over here.  Balance is adroitly obtained by the positioning of the reflections, the lanterns, the open window on the front left, the wall which leads to the silhouetted figure, that figure and the barely perceptible wall on the right.  And they deserve enumeration.  I''m mesmerized by that window.  I want to read the book or see the movie.  Absolutely terrific photograph.

<br/>Personal co-favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Black is as much a character in this image as the mysterious man at its top.  Very powerful and cinematic, noir.  The reflections of merely the orange lanterns and the entering light substantiate the whole, which whole is substantiated many times over here.  Balance is adroitly obtained by the positioning of the reflections, the lanterns, the open window on the front left, the wall which leads to the silhouetted figure, that figure and the barely perceptible wall on the right.  And they deserve enumeration.  I''m mesmerized by that window.  I want to read the book or see the movie.  Absolutely terrific photograph.

Personal co-favorite of the challenge.', '2021-10-30 16:18:51.000000', NULL, 0),
